Package: otzi
Version: 2.2.3
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 20)
Recommends: nginx
Maintainer: Ötzi <noreply@github.com>
Description: Self-hosted threshold Bitcoin vault
 Ötzi lets T-of-N parties hold bitcoin in one Taproot address. A FROST
 distributed key generation ceremony creates the key; any T parties
 review and co-sign spends. Key shares stay in party-held encrypted
 share files; the server stores public data only.
Homepage: https://github.com/mwaddip/otzi
